"""Editorial "If you liked..." guides: what to watch, play, read or hear after a well-loved title.

Content only; app/if_you_liked.py and app/routers/if_you_liked.py turn it into pages.
Each guide names what made its title work ("threads"), then recommends picks across
formats, each with why it fits, how it differs, and a caveat. Anchors were chosen from
the titles OmniTrackr members track most and the ones people most often search
"... like X" for.

Pick fields: kind (title_pages.KINDS key), title, year, creator (director, author or
artist; None for TV, anime and games), match (index into threads), why (stands on its
own, also shown by Pick for me), note (the comparison), caveat.
"""

